ion game recompiles in 5 seconds; hot reload is built in","Explicit, not implicit - no hidden type conversions, no silent allocations; options log shows exactly what the compiler produces","99% safe, not 100% - eliminates real-world C++ bugs pragmatically, without Rust-level restrictions","If it gets slow, you can fix it - manual delete to reduce GC pressure, AOT to C++ for native speed","The language reflects the problem - a compile-time macro system lets libraries reshape syntax to match the domain"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GaijinEntertainment/daScript/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"a245329402f72e12f991de618ec66bee038dbf8e8bb4330992b314b44860c7a0","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T11:06:01.610Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T19:54:09.215Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-17T19:14:21Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Daslang (formerly daScript) is a high-performance, statically typed programming language built for games and real-time applications.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GaijinEntertainment/daScript/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Daslang (formerly daScript) is a high-performance, statically typed programming language built for games and real-time applications.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GaijinEntertainment/daScript/blob/master/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"a245329402f72e12f991de618ec66bee038dbf8e8bb4330992b314b44860c7a0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GaijinEntertainment/daScript/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T19:54:09.217Z"},"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T08:38:46.479Z","latestRelease":{"name":"0.6.4","tag":"v0.6.4","publishedAt":"2026-09-18T00:37:08Z","url":"https://github.com/GaijinEntertainment/daScript/releases/tag/v0.6.4"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:38:46.479Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/411589cee3b667858f8d6cc0.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-17T20:13:45.604Z","url":"https://gaijinentertainment.github.io/try-dascript/"}],"demoHealth":{"url":"ht